WEBVTT

00:12.340 --> 00:14.240
<b>Ojun.</b>

00:14.610 --> 00:16.510
<b>What's the matter?</b>

00:18.350 --> 00:20.220
<b>Father, aren't you busy?</b>

00:23.020 --> 00:25.150
<b>I'm not too busy right now.</b>

00:26.720 --> 00:28.360
<b>Hey.</b>

00:28.490 --> 00:30.130
<b>Ojun, no!</b>

00:30.260 --> 00:31.330
<b>There, there.</b>

00:31.460 --> 00:33.530
<b>Tell me another story!</b>

00:33.760 --> 00:35.060
<b>Sure.</b>

00:35.230 --> 00:36.670
<b>Which story should I tell?</b>

00:37.230 --> 00:39.240
<b>Your father needs to rest.</b>

00:39.670 --> 00:41.170
<b>The one about the arrest!</b>

00:41.440 --> 00:42.810
<b>My...</b>

00:43.770 --> 00:47.340
<b>No. Tonight, I'll tell you a story
about a thief.</b>

00:48.210 --> 00:50.380
<b>There are many kinds of thieves out there.</b>

00:50.510 --> 00:52.150
<b>Some of them put me in awe.</b>

00:52.280 --> 00:55.050
<b>They are very talented
in the art of stealing.</b>

00:57.120 --> 00:58.150
<b>Oh, dear.</b>

00:58.290 --> 01:00.320
<b>Oh, don't sweat it.</b>

01:00.460 --> 01:02.260
<b>Come, Ojun.</b>

01:03.160 --> 01:05.690
<b>I was referring to those
who do "theft-workings."</b>

01:06.530 --> 01:07.760
<b>Theft-workings?</b>

01:08.200 --> 01:10.270
<b>Yup, they're the ones...</b>

01:10.400 --> 01:14.770
<b>...who work as carpenters every day
under a big boss.</b>

01:15.640 --> 01:19.410
<b>While they build
or reconstruct a residence,</b>

01:19.540 --> 01:23.410
<b>they secretly put in place clever workings
to be used when they come back to steal.</b>

01:23.810 --> 01:26.820
<b>So all they have to do is
to sneak in at night...</b>

01:27.150 --> 01:28.580
<b>...using those hidden workings...</b>

01:28.720 --> 01:31.590
<b>...while the people of the house are asleep.</b>

01:32.090 --> 01:36.260
<b>That's how they can vanish without a trace
after stealing the precious metals.</b>

01:37.090 --> 01:39.530
<b>Without hurting a soul, of course.</b>

01:39.660 --> 01:40.860
<b>Oh.</b>

01:41.400 --> 01:44.330
<b>Their work is quite fascinating.</b>

01:45.300 --> 01:49.740
<b>And there was one
especially talented man...</b>

01:55.710 --> 01:58.110
<b>-This is your fault.
-Sorry!</b>

01:58.250 --> 01:59.380
<b>What do we do?</b>

01:59.520 --> 02:01.350
<b>Father will kill me if he sees this!</b>

02:04.290 --> 02:06.390
<b>Why, that's a shame.</b>

02:06.720 --> 02:09.120
<b>Is that a tobacco tray?</b>

02:09.260 --> 02:10.760
<b>Let me see it.</b>

02:16.730 --> 02:18.630
<b>Amazing.</b>

02:19.130 --> 02:20.140
<b>Here you go.</b>

02:20.370 --> 02:22.400
<b>It's fixed!</b>

02:22.740 --> 02:24.810
<b>It's in better shape than before.</b>

02:27.480 --> 02:29.280
<b>Thanks, old man!</b>

02:29.410 --> 02:31.510
<b>What is your name?</b>

02:32.720 --> 02:34.420
<b>His name was...</b>

02:35.350 --> 02:38.550
<b>Wasuke of Dojo.</b>

03:40.520 --> 03:41.750
<b>The End of Wasuke of Dojo</b>

03:41.880 --> 03:43.490
<b>-Hey!
-You look good!</b>

03:43.620 --> 03:45.850
<b>When did you return?</b>

03:46.660 --> 03:47.920
<b>It's been a while.</b>

03:48.260 --> 03:50.790
<b>I haven't even been in contact.</b>

03:50.930 --> 03:51.990
<b>Magokichi!</b>

03:52.600 --> 03:54.300
<b>Magokichi!</b>

03:54.530 --> 03:55.560
<b>Coming.</b>

03:59.700 --> 04:01.570
<b>Wasuke.</b>

04:04.410 --> 04:06.640
<b>It's been three years, my friend.</b>

04:06.780 --> 04:08.880
<b>Where did the time go?</b>

04:09.010 --> 04:10.310
<b>Wasuke,</b>

04:10.450 --> 04:12.580
<b>you're very skilled with great character,</b>

04:12.720 --> 04:14.650
<b>but you never settle down.</b>

04:15.350 --> 04:16.390
<b>What do you think?</b>

04:16.520 --> 04:19.560
<b>Why don't you get married
and get settled down here?</b>

04:19.690 --> 04:22.890
<b>Boss, that can't happen.</b>

04:23.830 --> 04:28.760
<b>I can't get married with my social position.</b>

04:30.470 --> 04:33.540
<b>But, you'll be staying in Edo
for a while, won't you?</b>

04:33.670 --> 04:34.900
<b>I'm counting on you.</b>

04:35.940 --> 04:37.570
<b>Yes.</b>

04:41.580 --> 04:42.710
<b>Yup, now that's Wasuke.</b>

04:42.850 --> 04:44.850
<b>It's a completely different sound.</b>

04:44.980 --> 04:48.020
<b>Magokichi, flattering me won't get you
anywhere.</b>

04:48.350 --> 04:49.790
<b>Then I shouldn't bring it up.</b>

04:49.920 --> 04:52.320
<b>Hey.</b>

05:05.400 --> 05:07.000
<b>Sadaroku, what did I say?</b>

05:07.340 --> 05:09.670
<b>I quit the business.</b>

05:09.810 --> 05:11.910
<b>Now, don't say that.</b>

05:12.040 --> 05:14.540
<b>Just think that you're helping out
an old friend.</b>

05:14.980 --> 05:17.780
<b>Ever since my heart gave me trouble
five years ago,</b>

05:17.910 --> 05:20.980
<b>I've avoided treading on thin ice.</b>

05:21.320 --> 05:22.850
<b>Sorry, can't help you.</b>

05:23.750 --> 05:24.790
<b>Say...</b>

05:24.920 --> 05:27.360
<b>Boss Hachibei, who's now dead,
told me this.</b>

05:28.020 --> 05:29.990
<b>Wasuke, nine years ago,</b>

05:30.330 --> 05:33.360
<b>you did some "theft-working" on Kozuya.</b>

05:33.700 --> 05:36.870
<b>You still have the plan for it, right?</b>

05:37.000 --> 05:39.770
<b>I burned it when I decided
to quit the business.</b>

05:40.640 --> 05:43.870
<b>But it must still be in your head.</b>

05:44.010 --> 05:45.740
<b>A man like Wasuke of Dojo...</b>

05:45.870 --> 05:49.080
<b>...would never forget a plan
he concocted himself.</b>

05:49.410 --> 05:51.010
<b>That's enough.</b>

05:51.350 --> 05:52.980
<b>Don't involve me any further.</b>

05:57.820 --> 06:01.090
<b>I'll be back, Wasuke.</b>

06:06.560 --> 06:08.830
<b>Isn't that Wasuke of Dojo?</b>

06:09.130 --> 06:11.770
<b>So he's back in Edo.</b>

06:20.910 --> 06:23.380
<b>Why, that's great news.</b>

06:24.010 --> 06:25.110
<b>Hey there.</b>

06:26.480 --> 06:27.720
<b>Uncle Wasuke?</b>

06:28.550 --> 06:30.520
<b>Isotaro!</b>

06:31.490 --> 06:33.990
<b>Wasuke, let me tell you.</b>

06:34.120 --> 06:37.560
<b>Isotaro's now an assistant manager at Kozuya
at the young age of 19!</b>

06:37.690 --> 06:40.760
<b>At Kozuya, the prestigious paper wholesaler!</b>

06:40.900 --> 06:42.560
<b>Stop it, Father.</b>

06:42.700 --> 06:46.140
<b>He's always like this when he gets drunk.</b>

06:46.470 --> 06:49.070
<b>Sure. It's a big deal.</b>

06:49.400 --> 06:51.570
<b>The shop's predecessor
is so pleased with him...</b>

06:51.710 --> 06:54.540
<b>...that he wants Isotaro
to marry his daughter, Oshizu,</b>

06:54.680 --> 06:57.980
<b>so they can run the business together.
How about that?</b>

06:58.150 --> 07:00.920
<b>That's terrific!</b>

07:01.050 --> 07:02.520
<b>But...</b>

07:02.650 --> 07:06.790
<b>The predecessor passed away last year,
so the matter's still unsettled.</b>

07:06.920 --> 07:07.990
<b>I see.</b>

07:08.120 --> 07:11.830
<b>But, boy, am I impressed.</b>

07:12.860 --> 07:14.630
<b>Thanks a lot.</b>

07:14.760 --> 07:17.430
<b>Tell me, Isotaro. Are you happy now?</b>

07:18.500 --> 07:20.170
<b>Yes, I'm happy,</b>

07:20.500 --> 07:21.570
<b>Uncle Wasuke.</b>

07:22.000 --> 07:25.440
<b>All right, that's good to hear.</b>

07:30.650 --> 07:34.650
<b>Must be hard being an Assistant manager
at a large store.</b>

07:36.050 --> 07:38.090
<b>I'm sorry, Wasuke.</b>

07:38.220 --> 07:39.620
<b>Hey.</b>

07:39.760 --> 07:41.560
<b>You must apologize too, Ohiro.</b>

07:41.920 --> 07:42.960
<b>Hey, wait.</b>

07:43.090 --> 07:45.960
<b>What's the matter, Magokichi?</b>

07:46.600 --> 07:51.570
<b>It was all because of what we said
22 years ago.</b>

07:58.140 --> 08:00.540
<b>I'm a great fool.</b>

08:00.680 --> 08:05.080
<b>I let my wife die
while I took jobs in Edo.</b>

08:05.210 --> 08:07.220
<b>Don't be discouraged, Wasuke!</b>

08:07.550 --> 08:13.260
<b>He's right. You and Isotaro
were on her mind until the end.</b>

08:13.920 --> 08:15.960
<b>I'm sorry about this, Magokichi.</b>

08:16.090 --> 08:22.160
<b>Ohiro, thank you for looking after my wife
and taking care of Isotaro this whole time.</b>

08:22.500 --> 08:23.830
<b>Don't worry about it!</b>

08:23.970 --> 08:25.000
<b>But...</b>

08:25.130 --> 08:28.770
<b>We weren't blessed with a child,
and Isotaro's so cute.</b>

08:28.900 --> 08:31.640
<b>We'd love to take him in as our child!</b>

08:31.770 --> 08:34.710
<b>We've seriously talked about it.</b>

08:34.840 --> 08:37.050
<b>It's true. It doesn't trouble us at all.</b>

08:37.850 --> 08:40.950
<b>It might be better that way.</b>

08:41.080 --> 08:42.890
<b>What?</b>

08:43.020 --> 08:46.990
<b>A worthless father
can't be good for Isotaro!</b>

08:52.230 --> 08:54.660
<b>-Are you sure?
-Yes.</b>

08:54.800 --> 08:59.700
<b>Seems like I'm fated
to be without a wife or a kid.</b>

09:00.070 --> 09:02.600
<b>There's no such fate!</b>

09:02.740 --> 09:04.110
<b>Magokichi.</b>

09:05.540 --> 09:09.540
<b>We got to experience
so much happiness because of you.</b>

09:09.680 --> 09:11.750
<b>And Isotaro is a grown man now.</b>

09:11.880 --> 09:15.080
<b>We need to tell him who his real parents are.</b>

09:15.220 --> 09:18.890
<b>Yes, he's exactly right.</b>

09:19.250 --> 09:21.620
<b>Don't be ridiculous.</b>

09:22.320 --> 09:25.690
<b>Magokichi, Ohiro, you're Isotaro's
real parents.</b>

09:25.830 --> 09:28.030
<b>It's you two.</b>

09:28.930 --> 09:30.070
<b>Wasuke.</b>

09:30.200 --> 09:33.870
<b>I'll take "Uncle Wasuke" any day.</b>

09:34.000 --> 09:36.140
<b>Wasuke.</b>

09:39.240 --> 09:41.710
<b>How could you be so...?</b>

10:10.970 --> 10:13.980
<b>What is it, Hikojyu?</b>

10:18.750 --> 10:20.880
<b>Here, take a swig.</b>

10:21.020 --> 10:23.620
<b>Are you targeting Kozuya too?</b>

10:23.990 --> 10:26.860
<b>Kozuya, the paper wholesaler?</b>

10:26.990 --> 10:29.860
<b>No, never mind.</b>

10:31.160 --> 10:33.730
<b>Buttering me up won't do you any good.</b>

10:33.860 --> 10:36.970
<b>I cut all ties with that business.</b>

10:37.100 --> 10:38.870
<b>Is that really true?</b>

10:39.400 --> 10:40.870
<b>Yeah.</b>

10:44.240 --> 10:47.280
<b>So it's true? That's great.</b>

10:49.880 --> 10:53.280
<b>Hikojyu's changed quite a bit.</b>

10:55.680 --> 10:58.290
<b>Come to think of it, Kozuya's around here.</b>

10:59.090 --> 11:02.890
<b>Why don't I go and see how Isotaro works?</b>

11:07.200 --> 11:08.700
<b>Here it is.</b>

11:09.430 --> 11:11.070
<b>Good grief.</b>

11:11.200 --> 11:13.700
<b>How useless are you?</b>

11:13.840 --> 11:16.710
<b>Why don't you kneel down
on the ground for it?</b>

11:16.840 --> 11:19.440
<b>I'm very sorry about that.</b>

11:19.780 --> 11:20.810
<b>Oh?</b>

11:20.980 --> 11:22.940
<b>How many times do I have to tell you?</b>

11:23.310 --> 11:26.920
<b>Do you know how much this shop suffers
because of you?</b>

11:27.050 --> 11:28.380
<b>It's intolerable!</b>

11:28.720 --> 11:29.820
<b>Listen!</b>

11:29.950 --> 11:32.890
<b>Don't think you can get away with it next time!</b>

12:00.780 --> 12:03.250
<b>It's not looking like
it's gonna snow this year.</b>

12:03.890 --> 12:06.250
<b>I love the snow.</b>

12:06.390 --> 12:11.190
<b>Because when it snows,
we get no customers, so the shop closes.</b>

12:12.790 --> 12:14.060
<b>Isotaro.</b>

12:14.200 --> 12:17.730
<b>Are you getting harassed by the master?</b>

12:18.930 --> 12:22.340
<b>He must have a grudge against you...</b>

12:22.470 --> 12:26.070
<b>...for being favored by his predecessor.</b>

12:26.210 --> 12:27.410
<b>Uncle...</b>

12:32.510 --> 12:35.350
<b>I can't do this anymore.</b>

12:36.790 --> 12:39.960
<b>But, Isotaro,
your father and mother...</b>

12:40.290 --> 12:45.090
<b>...are so proud that you work at Kozuya.</b>

12:45.390 --> 12:48.130
<b>Don't worry. As long as you keep at it,</b>

12:48.260 --> 12:51.970
<b>the current master will have to recognize
your great work.</b>

12:52.100 --> 12:54.240
<b>You just gotta hang tight, Iso!</b>

12:54.370 --> 12:56.040
<b>Right?</b>

12:58.210 --> 12:59.440
<b>You're right.</b>

12:59.770 --> 13:01.540
<b>You're exactly right, Uncle.</b>

13:02.280 --> 13:05.150
<b>I'll try to do my best.</b>

13:07.850 --> 13:09.250
<b>Very well.</b>

13:17.960 --> 13:19.360
<b>I'm back.</b>

13:22.460 --> 13:24.130
<b>Is something the matter?</b>

13:24.930 --> 13:27.140
<b>Isotaro...</b>

13:27.270 --> 13:29.240
<b>How could you do such thing?</b>

13:30.810 --> 13:33.440
<b>That's... my luggage.</b>

13:36.340 --> 13:41.420
<b>I thought it was strange how you never
brought back that 57 ryo,</b>

13:41.820 --> 13:43.890
<b>and this was why.</b>

13:44.020 --> 13:45.290
<b>What?</b>

13:45.420 --> 13:47.590
<b>I definitely...</b>

13:47.920 --> 13:50.390
<b>-...brought it to you.
-Are accusing me of lying?</b>

13:50.530 --> 13:54.260
<b>No! But...
This must be some kind of mistake.</b>

13:54.400 --> 13:57.130
<b>Who will the magistrate's office believe?</b>

13:57.270 --> 13:59.400
<b>The master of Kozuya,</b>

13:59.530 --> 14:02.170
<b>or the problematic assistant manager?</b>

14:02.300 --> 14:03.440
<b>What do you all think?</b>

14:04.510 --> 14:06.070
<b>No.</b>

14:08.240 --> 14:10.280
<b>If the town knows about this,</b>

14:10.410 --> 14:16.150
<b>it will shame your
precious father and mother very much.</b>

14:22.260 --> 14:24.430
<b>How will you take responsibility for this?</b>

14:25.190 --> 14:28.500
<b>We can't have a thief working at our shop.</b>

14:30.930 --> 14:33.200
<b>Dinner is ready.</b>

14:33.340 --> 14:35.040
<b>Oh, finally.</b>

14:35.570 --> 14:40.080
<b>Thank you for treating me all this time.</b>

14:40.210 --> 14:44.250
<b>Don't mention it. You're family to us.</b>

14:44.380 --> 14:46.310
<b>That's right, Wasuke.</b>

14:46.620 --> 14:50.120
<b>Isotaro is who we, as husband and wife,
live for.</b>

14:50.250 --> 14:53.620
<b>We can never thank you enough!</b>

14:53.960 --> 14:56.320
<b>Wasuke, please know that.</b>

14:56.890 --> 14:58.530
<b>Magokichi...</b>

14:58.660 --> 14:59.930
<b>Ohiro...</b>

15:00.260 --> 15:02.930
<b>Eat up before it gets cold.
Here, have some tea.</b>

15:07.600 --> 15:09.170
<b>Is Magokichi here?</b>

15:09.300 --> 15:10.940
<b>Right here.</b>

15:11.070 --> 15:12.440
<b>I'm Magokichi.</b>

15:13.070 --> 15:15.110
<b>Isotaro, the assistant manager of Kozuya,</b>

15:15.240 --> 15:16.950
<b>is your son, is that right?</b>

15:17.980 --> 15:20.580
<b>Did something happen to Isotaro?</b>

15:26.290 --> 15:28.160
<b>Iso...</b>

15:29.920 --> 15:31.230
<b>Why?!</b>

15:32.130 --> 15:34.060
<b>Why?!</b>

15:39.030 --> 15:42.200
<b>We're the ones who want to cry.</b>

15:42.340 --> 15:46.040
<b>He's the one who stole our money
and killed himself here.</b>

15:46.610 --> 15:50.510
<b>What are we supposed to do
if bad rumors spread?</b>

15:56.720 --> 15:59.290
<b>I'm sure this is hard for you, Wasuke.</b>

15:59.420 --> 16:01.560
<b>But just don't give in to despair.</b>

16:01.690 --> 16:04.260
<b>I know that, Hikojyu.</b>

16:12.630 --> 16:14.270
<b>I see.</b>

16:14.740 --> 16:17.670
<b>So, do you think this Wasuke
is up to something?</b>

16:18.370 --> 16:19.540
<b>I don't know.</b>

16:19.670 --> 16:22.080
<b>But I sure hope not.</b>

16:24.610 --> 16:25.680
<b>Hikojyu.</b>

16:26.180 --> 16:30.090
<b>Keep an eye on Wasuke a little longer.</b>

16:41.030 --> 16:42.730
<b>I'm sorry, Iso.</b>

16:45.130 --> 16:48.200
<b>You were seeking my help...</b>

16:54.340 --> 16:56.010
<b>Magokichi?</b>

16:56.140 --> 16:58.110
<b>Ohiro?</b>

17:05.420 --> 17:07.660
<b>Hey! What do you think you're doing?!</b>

17:23.570 --> 17:26.310
<b>Don't come in when you can't pay!</b>

17:26.510 --> 17:27.710
<b>Damn drunk!</b>

17:32.310 --> 17:34.180
<b>Damn it!</b>

17:34.320 --> 17:36.750
<b>But Isotaro sure did surprise me with that.</b>

17:37.090 --> 17:40.620
<b>I never asked him to die.</b>

17:40.760 --> 17:43.790
<b>You're a scary man for framing him like that.</b>

17:44.130 --> 17:47.060
<b>Yes, I am! I'm a scary man!</b>

17:47.200 --> 17:49.830
<b>Oh, stop it!</b>

17:57.210 --> 17:59.440
<b>So, when is the day?</b>

18:01.540 --> 18:03.710
<b>As early as tonight.</b>

18:07.420 --> 18:09.750
<b>That's strange.</b>

18:10.080 --> 18:11.520
<b>He doesn't move.</b>

18:16.620 --> 18:18.360
<b>He got me!</b>

18:25.500 --> 18:26.770
<b>That's not it.</b>

18:39.610 --> 18:40.880
<b>I see.</b>

18:41.220 --> 18:42.850
<b>Well done, Hikojyu.</b>

18:43.180 --> 18:45.150
<b>Yes.</b>

18:46.750 --> 18:50.290
<b>Now that I've heard, I must go. But...</b>

18:52.230 --> 18:56.200
<b>-Since the moon is too beautiful tonight...
-What?</b>

18:56.430 --> 19:00.600
<b>I might be late since I can't
take my eyes off of it.</b>

19:04.740 --> 19:06.710
<b>Mr. Hasegawa!</b>

19:39.370 --> 19:41.180
<b>A contract?</b>

19:41.310 --> 19:43.680
<b>That's worthless for us to steal!</b>

19:44.310 --> 19:48.180
<b>Although it'd be devastating for Kozuya.</b>

19:50.350 --> 19:52.820
<b>Come on! Hurry up!</b>

20:07.340 --> 20:09.300
<b>Wasuke.</b>

20:09.640 --> 20:12.540
<b>-Damn it!
-This isn't good.</b>

20:12.670 --> 20:14.980
<b>-We've failed.
-No.</b>

20:16.440 --> 20:18.410
<b>-This is good enough.
-What?</b>

20:18.910 --> 20:22.280
<b>What are you doing? Go after that boat! Go!</b>

20:22.750 --> 20:25.920
<b>Dump all of this in the river.</b>

20:26.250 --> 20:27.290
<b>What?</b>

20:27.420 --> 20:29.890
<b>If we don't lighten the load,
we'll get arrested!</b>

20:35.530 --> 20:36.930
<b>Dump it!</b>

20:37.270 --> 20:38.400
<b>It needs to be lighter!</b>

20:45.740 --> 20:46.770
<b>We're in trouble!</b>

20:46.910 --> 20:48.640
<b>Make it lighter!</b>

20:51.310 --> 20:52.550
<b>How could you?</b>

20:58.320 --> 21:00.460
<b>Here come the finishing touches!</b>

21:22.410 --> 21:24.880
<b>How impressive.</b>

21:26.480 --> 21:27.720
<b>What's this?</b>

21:27.850 --> 21:29.720
<b>The contract!</b>

21:35.620 --> 21:37.790
<b>See this, Isotaro?</b>

21:38.760 --> 21:42.600
<b>It's your favorite snow.</b>

21:46.930 --> 21:49.700
<b>And four years later, this year,</b>

21:49.840 --> 21:52.610
<b>Kozuya went bankrupt.</b>

21:53.980 --> 21:57.310
<b>The money and contract stolen by Wasuke</b>

21:57.450 --> 21:59.410
<b>cost them everything.</b>

22:20.970 --> 22:27.110
<b>People are creatures born from dreams</b>

22:27.440 --> 22:32.980
<b>How can the sky look so blue?</b>

22:33.110 --> 22:38.950
<b>The past and future are just short-lived moments</b>

22:39.420 --> 22:44.760
<b>that exist between the blink of an eye</b>

22:47.730 --> 22:49.960
<b>Oh time…</b>

22:50.100 --> 22:53.970
<b>I could be a flower of spring</b>

22:54.100 --> 22:59.010
<b>in my next life</b>

22:59.910 --> 23:04.980
<b>And then…live on</b>

23:05.850 --> 23:11.150
<b>…and then…be loved</b>

23:11.920 --> 23:14.860
<b>La la la</b>

23:20.060 --> 23:23.560
<b>And then…cry</b>

23:26.870 --> 23:32.870
<b>…and then…fall</b>

23:39.850 --> 23:41.120
<b>"Kanshiro"</b>

23:41.650 --> 23:45.720
<b>Heizo received a letter from Kanshiro
while he was away.</b>

23:46.620 --> 23:49.120
<b>As he heads back home
from where they met...</b>

23:50.760 --> 23:53.630
<b>Next on Onihei, "The Man of the Past."</b>

23:53.760 --> 23:54.830
<b>"The Man of the Past"</b>
